---------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE / ALCANCE
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT license above covers the original Z80 source code written for this
project: the engine, the SD81 Booster driver code, the PEG sound programs and
the documentation.

It does NOT and cannot cover the material derived from the original 1978 Taito
arcade ROM, which remains the property of its rightful owner and is included
here only for interoperability and preservation purposes:

  - the sprite bitmaps in src/sprites.inc.asm and src/shield.inc.asm
  - the behaviour tables transcribed in src/ufo.inc.asm and src/bomb.inc.asm

Those parts are not licensed by this project and are excluded from the grant
above. Anyone reusing this code should replace them with their own assets.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------

La licencia MIT de arriba cubre el codigo fuente Z80 original escrito para este
proyecto: el motor, el codigo de manejo del SD81 Booster, los programas de
sonido del PEG y la documentacion.

NO cubre -ni puede cubrir- el material derivado de la ROM original del arcade
de Taito de 1978, que sigue siendo de su legitimo propietario y se incluye aqui
unicamente con fines de interoperabilidad y preservacion:

  - los bitmaps de sprites de src/sprites.inc.asm y src/shield.inc.asm
  - las tablas de comportamiento transcritas en src/ufo.inc.asm y
    src/bomb.inc.asm

Esas partes quedan excluidas de la cesion anterior. Quien reutilice este codigo
deberia sustituirlas por material propio.
